ack into product reviews on your WooCommerce site\u2014automatically.":[""],"Create free account":[""],"Free plan details":[""],"Free plan":[""],"No credit card required":[""],"25 review requests a month":[""],"Import your existing reviews":[""],"Built by the team behind CheckoutWC, trusted by <strong>8,000+ WooCommerce stores.<\/strong>":[""],"Example Reviewbird product review request email":[""],"for Aster & Oak":[""],"To: jamie@example.com":[""],"Sent 3 days after delivery":[""],"How would you rate this product?":[""],"We would love it if you would share a bit about your experience.":[""],"Linen Throw Blanket \u2014 Sage":[""],"Poor":[""],"Great":[""],"You received this email because you made a purchase from Aster & Oak.":[""],"Unsubscribe from review emails":[""]}}}